			"Message": "docs(Grove): Restore standard spacing in funding header\n\nRevert the replacement of standard ampersand (`&`) with the HTML entity `&amp;` in the \"Funding & Acknowledgements\" header of README.md. The previous change inadvertently altered the intended character representation, which is better served by the standard ASCII symbol for readability in this context.\n\nThis restores the visual consistency of the header with the rest of the document and ensures the title renders correctly across all Markdown viewers.",
			"SHA": "df68d0c46f9463e22cbfec63a503ea4ff0290067"
		},
